/* Storage adapter. Every method is async so Phase 2 can swap in a Supabase store with the same shape.
 * store.load()                -> {state, legacy}: browser copy ('spirit-v2'); if absent, old 'spirit-v1'/'selah-v1' converted in memory (old key is never written)
 * store.cache(state)          -> browser copy on every edit (not an explicit save)
 * store.saveCollection(state, collectionId) -> collection list/metadata change (local: browser copy; the file gets it on the next explicit save)
 * store.fetchSaved()          -> {exists, version, savedAt, state, legacy} last explicit save; old file formats are converted, never rewritten
 * store.saveDoc(collectionId, chapterId, doc, {language, blockIndex, state}) -> explicit save of ONE language of one paragraph; the other language and other chapters keep their last saved value
 * store.saveAll(state)        -> explicit save of everything;  store.listVersions() -> [{version, savedAt}];  store.savedState() -> last fetched/saved state or null
 * Saves reject with err.code==='conflict' when the saved copy moved since the last fetch/save.
 * State: {format:'spirit-v2', collections:[{id, name, mode:'bilingual'|'ko', order, chapters:[{id, title, order}]}], documents:{'<collectionId>/<chapterId>': doc}, trash:[]}
 * doc keeps the v1 shape (ko/en/paragraphDrafts/confirmed/ratings/history/reference…) plus optional source: {blocks:[{type,section,ko,en,koRef?,enRef?,pairs?}]} (bilingual) or {paragraphs:[[{text,cue?,heading?}]]} (ko).
 */
